          "type": "text",
          "text": "You are shepherding PR #860 through CI to merge.\n\nRepository: anchapin/nexus-proxy\nPR: https://github.com/anchapin/nexus-proxy/pull/860\nBranch: fix/issue-833-cached-embedder\nWorkdir: /home/alex/AI/worktrees/issue-833-cached-embedder\n\nSteps:\n1. Check CI status: gh pr checks 860\n2. IF CI is green:\n   a. Check mergeable: gh pr view 860 --json mergeable\n   b. If CONFLICTING → follow the merge conflict protocol\n   c. If MERGEABLE → merge: gh pr merge 860 --squash --delete-branch\n      Verify: gh pr view 860 --json mergedAt --jq '.mergedAt'\n      If null after retry → report BLOCKED\n   d. Clean up: git worktree remove ../worktrees/issue-833-cached-embedder\n3. IF CI is failing:\n   a. gh run list --branch fix/issue-833-cached-embedder --limit 1\n   b. gh run view <RUN_ID> --log\n   c. Apply minimal fix in the worktree\n   d. git add -A && git commit -m \"fix: resolve CI failure\" && git push\n   e. Wait for CI (poll every 30s, max 10 iterations)\n   f. If still failing → report blocker and STOP\n4. IF merge conflict:\n   a. git fetch origin develop && git rebase origin/develop\n   b. Auto-resolve; if unresolvable → STOP and report\n   c. git push --force-with-lease origin fix/issue-833-cached-embedder\n   d. Re-trigger CI\n\nReport back: final status (MERGED / BLOCKED / CONFLICT), iterations used.",
